# Normalize EOL for all files that Git considers text files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ── 二进制资产：绝不做换行转换 ─────────────────────────────
# 关键：MMD 的 .pmx/.vmd 是二进制格式，若被 text=auto 误判为文本并做
# CRLF→LF 转换，文件会被静默破坏（解析出错或模型崩坏）。显式声明为 binary。
*.pmx binary
*.vmd binary
*.vpd binary
*.pmd binary

# 贴图与图像
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.bmp binary
*.tga binary
*.dds binary
*.spa binary
*.sph binary

# Godot 导入产物 / 打包资源
*.res binary
*.scn binary
*.ctex binary
